      "content": "Shift some AC cooling hours to a standard ceiling fan, saving about 1.0 kg CO2e per hour.",
      "category": "appliances",
      "impact_estimate": "Saves 30.0 kg CO2e/month",
      "impact_level": "HIGH",
      "impact_value": 30.0,
